                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Seeing 1986 beside 2019 makes every familiar face feel like a clue. Are these echoes, or is something repeating?\n\nThe same streets feel completely different once you know who was there before. I keep pausing to look at the backgrounds. What did you notice in this episode?",
